t a claim; see jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md"},"claim":{"instrument_id":"EO:14039","later_source_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) With respect to any foreign person identified by the Secretary \nof State, in consultation with the Secretary of the Treasury, in a report \nto the Congress pursuant to section 7503(a)(1)(B) of PEESA, all property \nand interests in property of such person that are in the United States, \nthat hereafter come within the United States, or that are or hereafter come \nwithin the possession or control of any United States person are blocked \nand may not be transferred, paid, exported, withdrawn, or otherwise dealt \nin.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 1(a)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec1(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) Sanctions under subsection (a) of this section shall not apply to any \nforeign person with respect to whom a waiver under section 7503(f) of \nPEESA has been issued.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 1(b)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec1(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) The prohibitions in subsection (a) of this section apply except to \nthe extent provided by statutes, or in regulations, orders, directives, or \nlicenses that may be issued pursuant to this order, and notwithstanding \nany contract entered into or any license or permit granted prior to the \ndate of this order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 1(c)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec1(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 2. The Secretary of State shall implement section 7503(b) of PEESA \nas it applies to visas, and the Secretary of Homeland Security shall implement \nsection 7503(b) of PEESA as it applies to admission and parole. Such imple-\nmentation shall be consistent with any exceptions or waivers provided by \nstatute, or in regulations, orders, or directives that may be issued pursuant \nto this order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 2","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. The prohibitions in section 1 of this order include:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 3 (lead-in)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) the making of any contribution or provision of funds, goods, or services \nby, to, or for the benefit of any person whose property and interests in \nproperty are blocked pursuant to this order; and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 3(a)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec3(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) the receipt of any contribution or provision of funds, goods, or services \nfrom any such person.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 3(b)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec3(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) Any transaction that evades or avoids, has the purpose of evading \nor avoiding, causes a violation of, or attempts to violate any of the prohibi-\ntions set forth in this order is prohibited.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 4(a)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec4(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) Any conspiracy formed to violate any of the prohibitions set forth \nin this order is prohibited. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 15:43 Aug 23, 2021 Jkt 253001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\24AUE0.SGM 24AUE0lotter on DSK11XQN23PROD with FR_PREZDOC1\n=== PDF page 2 of 3 ===\n47206 Federal Register / Vol. 86, No. 161 / Tuesday, August 24, 2021 / Presidential Documents \nSec. 5. I hereby determine that the making of donations of the types of \narticles specified in section 203(b)(2) of IEEPA (50 U.S.C. 1702(b)(2)) by, \nto, or for the benefit of any person whose property and interests in property \nare blocked pursuant to this order would seriously impair my ability to \ndeal with the national emergency declared in Executive Order 14024, and \nI hereby prohibit such donations as provided by section 1 of this order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 4(b)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec4(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 6. For the purposes of this order:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 6 (lead-in)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec6","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) the term ‘‘entity’’ means a partnership, association, trust, joint venture, \ncorporation, group, subgroup, or other organization;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 6(a)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec6(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) the term ‘‘foreign person’’ means an individual or entity that is not \na United States person;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 6(b)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec6(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) the term ‘‘person’’ means an individual or entity; and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 6(c)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec6(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(d) the term ‘‘United States person’’ means any United States citizen, \nlawful permanent resident, entity organized under the laws of the United \nStates or any jurisdiction within the United States (including foreign \nbranches), or any person in the United States.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 6(d)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec6(d)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 7. For those persons whose property and interests in property are \nblocked pursuant to this order who might have a constitutional presence \nin the United States, I find that because of the ability to transfer funds \nor other assets instantaneously, prior notice to such persons of measures \nto be taken pursuant to this order would render those measures ineffectual. \nI therefore determine that for these measures to be effective in addressing \nthe national emergency declared in Executive Order 14024, there need be \nno prior notice of a listing or determination made pursuant to section \n1 of this order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 7","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec7","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 8. The Secretary of the Treasury, in consultation with the Secretary \nof State, is hereby authorized to take such actions, including the promulgation \nof rules and regulations, and to employ all powers granted to the President \nby IEEPA and PEESA, as may be necessary to carry out the purposes of \nthis order. The Secretary of the Treasury may, consistent with applicable \nlaw, redelegate any of these functions within the Department of the Treasury. \nAll departments and agencies of the United States shall take all appropriate \nmeasures within their authority to carry out the provisions of this order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 8","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec8","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 9. Nothing in this order shall prohibit transactions for the conduct \nof the official business of the Federal Government or the United Nations, \nincluding its programs, funds, and other entities and bodies, as well as \nits specialized agencies and related organizations, by employees, grantees, \nand contractors thereof.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 9","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec9","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) Nothing in this order shall be construed to impair or otherwise \naffect: \n(i) the authority granted by law to an executive department or agency, \nor the head thereof; or \n(ii) the functions of the Director of the Office of Management and Budget \nrelating to budgetary, administrative, or legislative proposals.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 10(a)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec10(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) This order shall be implemented consistent with applicable law and \nsubject to the availability of appropriations. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 15:43 Aug 23, 2021 Jkt 253001 PO 00000 Frm 00002 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\24AUE0.SGM 24AUE0lotter on DSK11XQN23PROD with FR_PREZDOC1\n=== PDF page 3 of 3 ===\n47207 Federal Register / Vol. 86, No. 161 / Tuesday, August 24, 2021 / Presidential Documents \n(c) This order is not intended to, and does not, create any right or benefit, \nsubstantive or procedural, enforceable at law or in equity by any party \nagainst the United States, its departments, agencies, or entities, its officers, \nemployees, or agents, or any other person.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3; Sec. 10(b)","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14039#sec10(b)","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"86 FR 47205, PDF pages 1-3","sha256":"df8b8af1e122efee7c3726e6512eec490678617e3e4fdefd09995a18a21403dd","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2021-08-24/pdf/2021-18306.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 19 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: current legal basis not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"yes"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:14039"}
